  "prefLabel": "Jus 2004.10 Release of Remains",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 2004.10 Release of Remains. The remains shall be released by the OCME, pursuant to RSA 611:14, upon a determination that no autopsy shall be ordered, or, if an external examination has been done after specimens have been obtained, or, if an autopsy has been ordered, once the autopsy and all testing, except for receiving such testing results, have been completed.\n\nSource. #8937, eff 7-14-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus2000.html"
}
